search_sources — retained server obligations
==================================================

Status: retained contract; current carve-out verification pending.

Search theory names with the existing substring match. This tool does not grep source content. Keep its public name, pattern, ordering and current readiness behavior.

Verification obligations
------------------------

T1 [scala-unit] Matches are session-qualified theory names, sorted deterministically.

T2 [scala-unit] No matching name returns a successful no-matches report.

